@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Receive the contract for the marketing campaign;
:Take the contract to the department;
:Input customer details into NKE;
:Are the customer details missing?;
:v1: Are the customer details missing? ({true, false}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = true] Yes)
:Contact the customers;
:Receive additional customer details;
:Create a suitable team;
else ([v1 = false] No)
:Form team with existing details;
endif
:Check previous campaigns for reusable material;
:Are reusable ideas found from previous campaigns?;
:v2: Are reusable ideas found from previous campaigns? ({true, false}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = true] Yes)
:Create a new concept;
:Integrate new ideas and add further points;
else ([v2 = false] No)
:No reusable ideas found;
:Proceed to database integration;
endif
:Integrate the revised campaign into the database;
:Present the concept to the relevant party for consideration;
:Is the concept accepted?;
:v3: Is the concept accepted? ({true, false}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v3 = true] Yes)
:Present the concept to the customer;
stop
else ([v3 = false] No)
:Rework the concept;
:Present the concept to the relevant party for consideration;
endif
